{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Volkolak: The Will of Gods is a 2D Soulslike Metroidvania in a dark Slavic fantasy setting. The action takes place in the Far-away State, a vast, rich world of medieval times for exploration. After the ominous curse of the necromancer Koschei the Immortal, its inhabitants go mad and turn into evil. The protagonist will have to fight his minions using a deep combat system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2499040/extras/bcfb0d3d7855124862f40fe32db72d05.avif?t=1766082431\" width=624 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2499040/extras/dd1249d1dfe13ab49c8fb6bc0a5ba293.poster.avif?t=1766082431\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2499040/extras/dd1249d1dfe13ab49c8fb6bc0a5ba293.webm?t=1766082431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2499040/extras/dd1249d1dfe13ab49c8fb6bc0a5ba293.mp4?t=1766082431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic Metroidvania with side-scrolling 2D action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traditional 2D frame-by-frame animation in dark style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features the mechanics of turning into a werewolf, which is the basis of the gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your class: the path of a bloodthirsty ghoul (Class: Cursed), or control your instincts with magic (Class: Volkolak), or take the path of a saintly warrior (Class: Bogatyr).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In werewolf form, you can gain additional abilities through the altars of pagan gods, and with some mythical creatures you can strike up a dialog and gain valuable information.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through the game in human form, equipping your character with various weapons (sword, axe, armor, torch, cloak, shield and more) and receive blessings at churches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique locations, NPCs and story adventures for each class. Three playthrough options and different game endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a large world inspired by Slavic mythology: the dungeons of Tsargrad, the Dark Forest or the Stinking Swamp.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn new skills and abilities that will open your way to secret places and unique locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this dark fairy tale you will meet mythical creatures: Leshy, Serpent, Baba Yaga, Koschey the Immortal, Firebird and many others.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 50 unique enemies and 15 mythical bosses! Epic battles with mythical creatures await you in this adventure. Unlock the power of ancient gods or use your sacred faith, the choice is yours!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2499040/extras/0b2c188e05d1c69c18c386ae6fdfcdef.avif?t=1766082431\" width=630 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2499040/extras/729c81da04b620250850dfd7a3054a80.poster.avif?t=1766082431\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2499040/extras/729c81da04b620250850dfd7a3054a80.webm?t=1766082431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2499040/extras/729c81da04b620250850dfd7a3054a80.mp4?t=1766082431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The vast, interconnected world is filled with mysticism, mythical creatures, and mystery.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Volkolak: The Will of Gods&quot; is a vast world inspired by Slavic mythology and folk tales. A dark fantasy universe as an interpretation of the greatest fears of ancient man. The gloomy atmosphere immerses the player in the unusual perception of Slavic legends as we are not used to see them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2499040/extras/247d0cfab1a1442ba615d8fc937e5f70.poster.avif?t=1766082431\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2499040/extras/247d0cfab1a1442ba615d8fc937e5f70.webm?t=1766082431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2499040/extras/247d0cfab1a1442ba615d8fc937e5f70.mp4?t=1766082431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2499040/extras/ce15e3ab9e82070a1efc14d025106cd7.avif?t=1766082431\" width=631 height=111 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2499040/1a16df84fc1afb87b264c944734270ba625cbbee.jpg"},{"name":"Necromancer ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2499040/b8ca4c11dc0c0cf2dcc085a071a7aa47399fb0a8.jpg"},{"name":"Exorcist of the Devil","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2499040/b325bb64eb96b3d591eb7771b6927481c1db2be8.jpg"},{"name":"Witcher","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2499040/363ce4ae4cfb56762ab80941e4c2d8cd7f9c0330.jpg"},{"name":"Father, Forgive Me","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2499040/aa664333588787ca7c37c468017e5ad4fab67981.jpg"},{"name":"Son of the Blacksmith","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2499040/5fb0707f7c3ea9ed1937bc9117b11dae57b35398.jpg"},{"name":"The Gift of the Gods","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2499040/9501bbb510921945f47c1e4040f7403b8e0baa8b.jpg"},{"name":"Plague Healer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2499040/c64d721912cd9498482c3a79d52178e1f34d7f5f.jpg"},{"name":"Outcast","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2499040/d9e84ad69b67bff351356eebe0b357e5c6b2db3b.jpg"},{"name":"Wolf in Sheep's Clothing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2499040/dd2e6fa770384834dbbc349ffd551fb6f8e8c4e0.jpg"}],"total":21},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2499040?t=1766082431","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2499040/56c02e677b5e4e727df6f49c12a40ef6e69a5f1f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766082431","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2499040/7b9baada56b25f91b558d93b84af37f6db3d7bb2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766082431","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2499040/7b9baada56b25f91b558d93b84af37f6db3d7bb2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766082431","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game may contain content not suitable for all ages or for viewing at work: Scenes of violence or cruelty, Scenes of murder."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3127970,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2499040/extras/e8df4f93d93ad698548ea2833e66c481.avif?t=1766082431\" width=600 height=1686 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Volkolak: The Will of Gods is a 2D Soulslike Metroidvania in a dark Slavic fantasy setting. The action takes place in the Far-away State, a vast, rich world of medieval times for exploration. After the ominous curse of the necromancer Koschei the Immortal, its inhabitants go mad and turn into evil. The protagonist will have to fight his minions using a deep combat system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2499040/extras/bcfb0d3d7855124862f40fe32db72d05.avif?t=1766082431\" width=624 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2499040/extras/dd1249d1dfe13ab49c8fb6bc0a5ba293.poster.avif?t=1766082431\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2499040/extras/dd1249d1dfe13ab49c8fb6bc0a5ba293.webm?t=1766082431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2499040/extras/dd1249d1dfe13ab49c8fb6bc0a5ba293.mp4?t=1766082431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic Metroidvania with side-scrolling 2D action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traditional 2D frame-by-frame animation in dark style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features the mechanics of turning into a werewolf, which is the basis of the gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your class: the path of a bloodthirsty ghoul (Class: Cursed), or control your instincts with magic (Class: Volkolak), or take the path of a saintly warrior (Class: Bogatyr).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In werewolf form, you can gain additional abilities through the altars of pagan gods, and with some mythical creatures you can strike up a dialog and gain valuable information.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through the game in human form, equipping your character with various weapons (sword, axe, armor, torch, cloak, shield and more) and receive blessings at churches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique locations, NPCs and story adventures for each class. Three playthrough options and different game endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a large world inspired by Slavic mythology: the dungeons of Tsargrad, the Dark Forest or the Stinking Swamp.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn new skills and abilities that will open your way to secret places and unique locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this dark fairy tale you will meet mythical creatures: Leshy, Serpent, Baba Yaga, Koschey the Immortal, Firebird and many others.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 50 unique enemies and 15 mythical bosses! Epic battles with mythical creatures await you in this adventure. Unlock the power of ancient gods or use your sacred faith, the choice is yours!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2499040/extras/0b2c188e05d1c69c18c386ae6fdfcdef.avif?t=1766082431\" width=630 height=106 /></span